    "title": "Police connect with residents at 'Coffee with a Cop' event | News | yumasun.com",
    "text": "Residents gathered Wednesday morning at Mostly Muffins on West 16th Street for “Coffee with a Cop,” a community event aimed at fostering open dialogue between law enforcement and the people they serve.\nThe Yuma Police Department hosted the event from 7 to 10 a.m., inviting community members to share coffee and conversation in a relaxed setting. According to YPD, the program is designed to help residents discuss local issues, ask questions and get to know the officers who patrol their neighborhoods.",
